# SHA-256 of every third-party prebuilt native library the app packages, one
# line per ABI and library: <abi>/<library> <sha256>. These libraries arrive
# inside Maven artifacts (net.zetetic:sqlcipher-android:4.13.0 and
# androidx.camera:camera-core:1.4.2) and are pinned here independently of
# Gradle dependency verification, which the F-Droid reference build removes.
# The gate verifyThirdPartyNativeArtifacts checks the merged native libraries
# against these values before they are packaged; a dependency upgrade updates
# this file together with the dependency version (see docs/SUPPLY_CHAIN.md).
